{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01511-s03","batch":1511,"shard":3,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":60,"shard_end_exclusive":80,"translated_count":10,"entries":[{"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:d362b5005ae8a578b94dfeea","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"誕生日プレゼント？“ニャンコ”！\r\n“ニャンコ”がいいですっ！\r\n“ニャンコ”ならばなんでも…っ！","source_fingerprint":"8c1ccb04695459e4d753bcce46bb5dbcb8d5304eadd9331545ce39159d1af707","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10014"],"target_text":"Quà sinh nhật ư? “Mèo con”!\r\nTôi muốn “mèo con”!\r\nChỉ cần là “mèo con” thì gì cũng được...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:72dcc229898efb0ead9a6ee8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"貴方にお知らせがきていましたよ。\r\nさ、即開封しましょう。","source_fingerprint":"e93104e4b5b53e89c1ea135d5f9ce1c2a9ba900937aa7b22025824e5e0406f9b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10015"],"target_text":"Có thông báo gửi đến ngài đấy.\r\nNào, mở ngay thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:9109377e8510fbafe258f9f2","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"プレゼントを開けましょう。\r\n“足”の早さ最高速の品かも。","source_fingerprint":"fe375eedf9d8fc5e4ee6bf90452c6be4ab519de076f668135e5df3b97d908ba5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10016"],"target_text":"Mở quà thôi.\r\nBiết đâu là món đồ có “chân” nhanh nhất đấy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:34ff5a96e422adca0601fa14","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"気づいた時にはミッション完了。\r\nフッ、速すぎてしまったか。","source_fingerprint":"70b5a9f3e9633b6053763aa012e82e3a2ce5f4eb92c7eb298538d6ba779e0e9d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10017"],"target_text":"Đến lúc nhận ra thì nhiệm vụ đã hoàn thành.\r\nHừm, có lẽ tôi nhanh quá rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:7e81b9edd88d979ca247aa61","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"近々イベントが開催されます。\r\n参加しましょう。なんなら\r\n始まる前に終わらせましょう。","source_fingerprint":"494408abba6f2ece2598fac1dd371b025344aebbaafba23552d1995abdf05804","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10018"],"target_text":"Sắp có sự kiện diễn ra.\r\nHãy tham gia thôi. Nếu được thì\r\nta hoàn thành nó trước cả khi bắt đầu nhé.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":65,"uid":"zhcn:7cc4cdb1d6ab33ed0e0a1f83","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"イベント開催中です。最速完走記念\r\nパーティーの会場は予約完了。\r\nスピーチ原稿も執筆済で安心です。","source_fingerprint":"bf97f56296fca834651ff9b68cbf47d90601b2c0d2c0a054df14561332d9a8d8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10019"],"target_text":"Sự kiện đang diễn ra. Địa điểm cho bữa tiệc\r\nkỷ niệm hoàn thành nhanh nhất đã đặt xong.\r\nBài phát biểu cũng viết xong rồi, thật yên tâm.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:79decc35e9fbf6bf86b4e136","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"失速したか…！","source_fingerprint":"939e6cdc3e576e7e1d46b22d6b409a4d748b08600db239e404647f33aad59b2c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","1002"],"target_text":"Mất tốc rồi sao...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:8b93f9b14af0dd880a6f118c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが上がったそう\r\nです。最速で見に行きましょう。","source_fingerprint":"ed0efdfce6d923ae9a6ebc8477bf01b31b064940f0a289517f44d55c1868c75b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","10021"],"target_text":"Nghe nói cấp Archive đã tăng rồi.\r\nHãy đi xem với tốc độ nhanh nhất nào.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:d07783981b9fb47262a7513a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"なかなかの速さ…！","source_fingerprint":"82a6c347f4831e3e8263fce927fa1f856d7bfbf86d5b6dc136c9263b0cbd1c27","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","1003"],"target_text":"Khá nhanh đấy...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:a3aa22f0ec1a1d0213e7bf34","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"光の壁を抜けたか！","source_fingerprint":"d5c8ea504f08eec0a8a056503fdc8d6cc22a495bbe875899e8c79aec97c20c05","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","1004"],"target_text":"Đã vượt qua bức tường ánh sáng rồi sao!","reviewed":true}]}